e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Maximal}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Maximal}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Maximal}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Maximal}(B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d21586b2bafee69\" href=\"?note=5d21586b2bafee69\" title=\"20-df-maximal\">20-df-maximal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f5512c46390bf2\" href=\"?note=64f5512c46390bf2\" title=\"20-df-automorphism\">20-df-automorphism</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 cited-statement-proof-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soare\\text{-}auto}\\vdash\n\\exists\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)\\ [\\Phi(A)=B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soare\\text{-}auto}\\vdash\n\\exists\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)\\ [\\Phi(A)=B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Lerman–Soare 1980 引言明确回顾 Soare 的极大集自动同构结果。作用的结构是 c.e. 集合格 E，而不是 c.e. 度结构；不得据此推出 A≡_T B。本轮核实二手回顾所对应的数学陈述，原 Soare 论文和完整扩张定理证明仍待补。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare (1980), Introduction, p.135，回顾 Soare [17]</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Rema